 "name_zh": "达夫尼修道院、俄西俄斯罗卡斯修道院和希俄斯新修道院",
 "name_zh_source": "unesco_official",
 "name_en": "Monasteries of Daphni, Hosios Loukas and Nea Moni of Chios",
